  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Justice, Rule of Law and Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved access to justice, enhanced rule of law and increased protection of constitutionally entrenched human rights. 
This will be achieved by continued engagement with the judiciary who will be pivotal in improving rule of law, access to justice and human rights and in addressing corruption cases.
The implementing partner will be the International Development Law Organisation (IDLO).</narrative>
  </description>
